{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/255","id":4753555482,"node_id":"PR_kwDON3f2aM8AAAABG1WAGg","html_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/255","diff_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/255.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pull/255.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/issues/255","number":255,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: restore protected async vars after Reflex 0.10 hydration","user":{"login":"masenf","id":1524005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MjQwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1524005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf","html_url":"https://github.com/masenf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/masenf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Reflex 0.10 reconnects through `hydrate_and_load`, but the auth middleware only recognized `hydrate`. After an authenticated user navigated to or reloaded a public page, the full snapshot replaced async-checked computed values with their placeholders without marking them for page-load redelivery.\n\nHandle both hydration events so protected values are redelivered after identity resolution. Add unit regressions for repeated hydration, async sibling-state authorization, denied checks, and stale identities, and strengthen the browser regression to verify two successive reloads.\n\nValidation:\n- Reproduced the public-page browser failure before the fix on Reflex `main` (`e080fbf`).\n- Reflex `main`: 1,184 unit tests passed (1 skipped), all 24 auth browser tests passed, and the strengthened repeated-reload regression passed.\n- Reflex 0.9.12: 496 auth unit tests passed (6 skipped), and all 24 auth browser tests passed.\n- Ruff lint and formatting passed. Pyright passed on 0.9.12; the seven import-export diagnostics on `main` were identical on the unchanged baseline.\n\nCloses #252.","created_at":"2026-10-06T03:01:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T04:17:56Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T04:17:56Z","merged_at":"2026-10-06T04:17:56Z","merge_commit_sha":"faae5d2db97d00fb5736f29339c572b182e4b304","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/255/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/255/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/issues/255/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reflex-dev/reflex-enterprise/statuses/82b182851c758491594a653088c8b86b866a4046","head":{"label":"reflex-dev:codex/fix-auth-hydration-reflex-010","ref":"codex/fix-auth-hydration-reflex-010","sha":"82b182851c758491594a653088c8b86b866a4046","user":{"login":"reflex-dev","id":104714959,"node_id":"O_kgDOBj3Szw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104714959?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/reflex-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reflex-